  "data": {
    "body": "Let $\\mathrm{A}$ be an $m \\times n$ matrix. Which of the following statements must be TRUE?\n\n(i) If the equation $A \\mathbf{x}=\\mathbf{0}$ has only the trivial solution, then $A \\mathbf{x}=\\mathbf{b}$ has at most one solution.\n\n(ii) If the linear transformation $\\mathbf{x} \\mapsto A \\mathbf{x}$ is one-to-one, then $m \\geq n$.\n\n(iii) If $m>n$, then the columns of $A$ are linearly dependent.\n\n(iv) If $A$ has $m$ pivot columns, then columns of $A$ span $\\mathbb{R}^{m}$.",
    "solution": [
      3
    ],
